# clang-format ≈ Prettier for C++.
#
# The hand-written addon already follows Google style (2-space indent, left-
# aligned pointers `float* p`, 80-col, Egyptian braces), so this just pins it.
#
# Editors with the clangd extension format-on-save from this file with NO extra
# install. The CLI (`pnpm native:format`) needs `brew install clang-format`.
#
# Vendored code under vendor/ has its own .clang-format (DisableFormat) so the
# third-party dr_libs sources are never rewritten.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++17
